  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Plurimis quidem in locis, imo identidem codex ille a Soliloquiorum edi- tionibus diversus est :",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "at nos postremum duntaxat ejus libri caput, quod nondum est ed tum, proferen- dum censuimus.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "De pretio tamen, atque auctoritate hujusce additamenti Lectori d judicandum relinqui- mus. En ea itaque quæ post voces illas canos meos invenimus (a).",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Pius at Deus te ducat ad sublimia sua, introduc eum ad intima tua; certum enim tibi sit, quod de- lictum tuum nimis diligis,",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "si quamvis fortasse sum- me, nondum eum tamen singulariter diligis : quod est, si alienam aliquam consolationem quæris, vel recipis.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cogita ergo, quid sit, quod in vita tua ar- dentius dilexisti, anxius concupisti, quod te jucun- dius afficiebat, ceterisque omnibus profundius delec- tabat, vel potuit delectare.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Considera ergo, si eandem affectionis violentiam, delectationis abundantiam sentis, quando in summi dilectoris desiderium inar- descis, quando in ejus dilectione requiescis :",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "dubium enim non est, quod illum affectionis tuæ sinum nondum tenet, si intimæ dilectionis tuæ aculeus ani- mam tuam in divinis affectibus minus penetrat,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "te- pidius exagitat, quam in alienis affectibus aliquando penetrare, vel exagitare solebat, vel posset aliquo modo tractus (b) alicujus affici :",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "tu quoque ab eo mi- nus diligeris, si ad theoricos illos excessus nondum vocaris, vel vocantem sequi nondum merueris.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Jam non dicam, inquit, vos servos, sed amicos meos, quia omnia, quæcunque audivi a Patre meo, nota feci vobis (c). Sublimitas ergo divinarum revelationum est manifestum indicium,",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quod perfecte diligis, vel diligeris, si in summorum desiderio ad superna ra- peris, et in anagogicos illos conatus mentis aliena- tione transis.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et qui huic contemplationis virtuti vult vacare, necesse est, ut discat requiescere non solum (a) Confer operum S. Augustini editionem nos- tram tom.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "VI col. 863-898. Edit. ab operibus malis, sed etiam a cogitationibus super- vacuis.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Opus etiam est compunctione, suspiriisque magis, quam argumentis : crebris gemitibus magis, quam copiosis argumentationibus;",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "lacrymis, quam sententiis; oratione, quam lectione; gratia lacryma- rum, quam scientia litterarum;",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "cœlestium potius contemplatione, quam terrestrium occupatione. 0 lux mentium Deus, expelle a me stultitiæ noctem, et dona mihi sapientiæ diem :",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "erue veritates, et jus- titiæ solem de profundissimis naturæ tuæ sinibus omnem intellectum superantibus in æthere animi mei :",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "super terram cordis mei extingue phantasias corporum, et phantasmata variarum cogitationum mearum. Crea prolem intelligentiarum tuarum in utero mentis meæ.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol#PL47.SOL.2.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl47_6_sol",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.SOL.2.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Effunde spiritum tuum super aquas infirmitatis meæ, ut conversus ad te, confor- mis Filii tui, videam te in te, et omnia sub te. O tu purissima veritas,",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
